Over a year later, in The Knight in the Ruins, Charcadet reunited with Pagogo in the same ruins. Once it noticed some of its Pokémon friends were missing, Charcadet went looking for them with Pagogo accompanying it. Charcadet and Pagogo found its friends with Liko, as it witness her protecting them from a Laquium-afflicted . Seeing Scovillain about to attack Liko when she went to protect , Charcadet canceled out the attack by using and decided to the . Thanks to its Ability, Charcadet was able to take in the opponent's attacks and strike back with a boosted Ember, allowing Pagogo to intervene and purify the Laquium from Scovillain's body. Later, with the support of its friends, Charcadet chose to join Liko's team.
